@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

actor User
participant System
database "Stored Users" as Users

== Request Login ==

User -> System: Choose to log in on welcome screen
System --> User: Display login screen

== Authentication ==

alt User enters credentials
    User -> System: Enter username and password, click Login
    System -> Users: Check entered information against stored users
    Users --> System: Match result

    alt Username or password does not match
        System --> User: Display error message
    else Information matches
        System --> User: User is logged in
        System --> User: Send confirmation message
    end

else User cancels login
    == Cancel Login ==
    User -> System: Cancel login
    System --> User: Pop up window to confirm cancellation
    User -> System: Confirm cancellation
    System -> System: Discard unsaved login information
    System --> User: Use case ends
end

@enduml